{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02b3e3bce17c2b64e9d649a35f8c0d3a596d98e1125d8cd00e6d4ba158b7fed8", "ja": "（今日は、次の定期公演のミーティングがある。\nそろそろ集合の時間だけど……）", "zh": "（今天要开下一场定期公演的会议。差不多到集合时间了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "a62cc20b81962dde43103b0876a5a870065537047afe8755224b710742ebf279", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a410aafd8ed196fe68e87d80284df22636469ee6786db7a7bf3c90da4376205e", "ja": "お疲れさまです。今日はこれから、\n定期公演のミーティングですよね？", "zh": "辛苦了。今天接下来是定期公演的会议，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1003_p", "source_sha256": "048c64a57ec995cc43f1a54865586818b96c705895594064c6d862b4c35c22f7", "ja": "星梨花、紬。お疲れさま！\nレッスン、もう終わったんだな。", "zh": "星梨花、紬。辛苦了！\n训练已经结束了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "b4399694b98046e845057aed6ade19f22df8b83160770681216659865577859c", "ja": "はい。今日は定期公演のミーティングがあったので、\n5分早く終わりになりました！", "zh": "是的。因为今天要开定期公演的会议，所以提前了5分钟结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7b0d59fa92bcb000ef824b90353cb89d039fcece2cbdd30f75c7b2b2cf388b17", "ja": "だからといって、さぼったりはしていません。その分、\n5分早く始めていただきましたので、ご心配なく。", "zh": "不过，我并没有因此偷懒。作为补偿，已经请大家提前5分钟开始了，请不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c6036027f3182619e8d40b03e4eb27167323095880243e144bbd0dd84502f757", "ja": "それで、次の公演は新曲の披露があると、歌の\n先生にうかがったのですが。今回は、どなたが……？", "zh": "听说下一场公演要演唱新歌，是吗？我从声乐老师那里听说了。那这次由谁来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1007_p", "source_sha256": "730ae685c3c3955d8f39650bdb9868785c8ad8dd8cb9cb9704e0038c5add1ed8", "ja": "ああ、その話だけど……。\nそろそろ時間だし、控え室に行ってから話そうか。", "zh": "啊，关于那件事……差不多到时间了，我们去休息室后再聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1010_p", "source_sha256": "636548e835348a02768ba4383fb70e70ed05c1ab798ecf5fb5e5b83907df314f", "ja": "お疲れさま……おっ、\nみんな、集まってるみたいだな！", "zh": "辛苦了……哦，看来大家都到齐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "99668d644f14b0542a6c93e09d0d7b51f02bf715d9377c69d1458599bd4d8d2b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　今、静香ちゃん\nとジュリアさんと、新曲の話をしてたんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！刚才我正在和静香\n还有茱莉亚先生聊新歌的事呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1012_p", "source_sha256": "905453406fade09be83a3e0200a2bcb73dd3c8c77fa1b8876018dae83b92a1bd", "ja": "あれ？　紬と星梨花はともかく……\n未来は、どうして新曲の事知ってるんだ？", "zh": "奇怪？紬和星梨花先不说……\n未来你是怎么知道新歌的事的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "34f3dc68e419971341cedaaa2bc698fa4f815a23aed0be8baa099fdaca83475a", "ja": "え？　ジュリアさんが、\n新曲だって言ってたからですけど……あれ？", "zh": "诶？因为茱莉亚先生说是新歌来着……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "b5c36baf26bcb65aaecc6380bbb3215cce21192db7300bd36702b68a7eb94094", "ja": "おいおい、未来、{$P$}。\nなんだか話が、こんがらがってきてないか？", "zh": "喂喂，未来，还有{$P$}。\n总觉得事情好像变得越来越复杂了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "ef4772b753751019429b8700edea4add16fe5ffbdbdab3db7a07e65d9ca2be5c", "ja": "そうですよ。{$P$}、ちゃんと\n説明してください。新曲がどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "是啊。{$P$}，请好好说明一下。新歌怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dbb5a47d44113f45759104cb624c5f9f1306a7379ce9e43ebf8b423922e85ee4", "ja": "あ、ああ。次の定期公演の事なんだけど……今回は、\nここにいる5人に出演してもらおうと思っている。", "zh": "啊、啊啊。是关于下次定期公演的事……这次，我想请在场的5人出演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1017_p", "source_sha256": "657e00f2ee3cde0da21493b4fc82034226dc0273749a26a9dc4adbc83ac456fa", "ja": "そこで、静香の新曲を披露しようと思ってるんだけど\n……どうだ？　静香。", "zh": "所以，我想在那场公演上展示静香的新歌……怎么样？静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "e9d041dbc26b660aded53278aa71f4d0ac1fd82c77a2365283b6d02972e613fd", "ja": "は、はいっ！\n……とうとう、来た……！", "zh": "是、是的！\n……终于来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "72c0ab2384da9a77665f0297c74870d18086f80611c7ecff986c8b8413112001", "ja": "もちろん、引き受けさせていただきます！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "当然愿意接受！今后请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4c4052cb2855712b61533aa98a9b55a95b2d14712511ec9110f65d5c4fd6b7d2", "ja": "よし、決まりだな。定期公演のレッスン以外に、\n歌のレッスンが増えるけど、頑張ろう！", "zh": "好，决定了。除了定期公演的训练之外，还会增加歌唱训练，不过我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "83113aa0fbfeaa1afddebd2444e94e5add4efe2e277f9e400cf393646063e5fa", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！\nがんばります！", "zh": "好的，当然！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a1195ad69e686451a2dc32dfdd441084b70d1e6fd725583afc97d928b7eac4b", "ja": "やったな、シズ！　おめでとう♪", "zh": "太棒了，静！恭喜你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "e4e6fe61df6c1861d89e3ca7f883b247f50a3cd35a4f724a173e7a8d38b82477", "ja": "わぁ～、静香ちゃんの新曲！？\n{$P$}さん、どんな曲なんですか？", "zh": "哇～，静香的新歌！？\n{$P$}先生，是首什么样的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1024_p", "source_sha256": "469b4b671c370b5e8f6cb502d457fc46f79ac3a30a21dd49555673308ce5bf69", "ja": "そう言うと思って、持ってきたよ。みんなにも、\nバックで踊ってもらう事になるからな。……ポチッと。", "zh": "就知道你会这么说，所以我带来了。大家也要在后面伴舞……啪嗒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "92d041baefcff8c7ac3ff0b24767bcec170be69694f320ce869015dd03b774c7", "ja": "あ……これが、私の新曲……？", "zh": "啊……这就是我的新歌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "215fbf4ec3ef21c9c944ce683f29fbdb0bf10f4eff1789d0e8ef9c00cde6ee2c", "ja": "わぁ……♪　なんだか、ワクワクする曲ですね！\n静香ちゃんがどんなふうに歌うのか、楽しみだな～！", "zh": "哇……♪ 总觉得这是一首让人心情雀跃的歌呢！\n真期待静香会用什么样的方式来演唱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "df8a9f652cf3badb0f3a1b5c80d91fdc22faa0eab0e77af72ddfb8122743ca09", "ja": "ああ。シズの表現力の幅が、広がりそうな曲だな。\nレッスンがんばれよ！　あたしもサポートするからさ。", "zh": "啊。感觉这首歌能拓宽静香的表现力呢。\n好好加油练习啊！我也会支持你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "da4c7ac74731cd8ef4779b37a4971520863bf23b53bca460f3fd2820ad9c8a87", "ja": "はいっ、ありがとうございます！\n私……この曲を、しっかり自分のものにしてみせます！", "zh": "好的，谢谢您！\n我……一定会把这首歌彻底变成自己的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0bd624ba2bd6868d9ebea7e03cce9ce77a5150078f57418996a9186537814d0", "ja": "私の、新曲……ふふっ。\n歌うの、楽しみだな……！", "zh": "我的新歌……呵呵。\n真期待唱它啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1032_sizukatiti", "source_sha256": "9bf29516134d7fbfd0d407c05403e894bfa15a4c4a46b6e723b29483bcd7a8ea", "ja": "静香、どうかしたのか？\n今日は随分と機嫌が良さそうだな。", "zh": "静香，怎么了？\n你今天看起来心情特别好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d6776a9a160a7882d27904020960de14ac2791dedae5e2e533621e1b1582721", "ja": "あっ、お父さん！　そうなの。実は次の\n定期公演で、新曲を歌わせてもらうことになったんだ。", "zh": "啊，爸爸！是的。其实我被安排在下次的定期公演上演唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e81eaddb6cee7cc3e5e180f1afd548470e6ce01ac224feec6f5fbaab98f38c5", "ja": "そ、それで！　もし良かったらなんだけど、\n次の定期公演、お父さんとお母さんにも……。", "zh": "所、所以！如果可以的话，下次的定期公演，也希望爸爸和妈妈能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1035_sizukatiti", "source_sha256": "9a065c5d629249bdfdca2d425f63de3ed979e2633cd59ad9b7e3ccdc5b4f1b0a", "ja": "それは、今までと何が違うんだ？\n劇場で新曲を歌う。それだけの事だろう？", "zh": "那和以前有什么不同？\n不就是在剧场演唱新歌吗？就只是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "a943632e312f939fb467ebf7fa148adce79079a81a741417657cd7c6838ab0b4", "ja": "え……う、うん。そうだけど……。", "zh": "诶……嗯、是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1037_sizukatiti", "source_sha256": "2d38ca0cdb8ccb6c1fa2a4130b734217e289ff432d4f651f2fe1fea1ae73a6a4", "ja": "……お前がアイドルになって、それなりに時間が\n経ったと思っていたが。まだその程度なんだな。", "zh": "……我原本以为你成为偶像，也过去不少\n时间了。结果现在还是只有这点程度啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1038_sizukatiti", "source_sha256": "f29d942ced10099f0297fd76c1b68f3954f556036c163e573f283ce028f3ab94", "ja": "静香。アイドルは中学生の間だけ、\nという約束は忘れていないな？", "zh": "静香。你没忘记那个约定吧？\n只在初中期间当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "addc8f32354e9c6d42bc75a992d106e994f47f6aab9f80d4ac3c06e25ac568ff", "ja": "それは……。で、でも、私！　卒業までには、\n絶対に結果を出してみせます！　だから……！", "zh": "那是……可、可是我！在毕业之前，一定会取得成果给你看！所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
