{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_067_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "712a4928d79df85d2e6ffd5d2158dc97e7f7b978349e215353508a406f55fb3d", "ja": "そ、そんなことない……！\n全然進んでないなんて……そんなこと……。", "zh": "不、不是那样……！\n说什么完全没有进展……才不是那样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
